        <h1>Smart India Hackathon (SIH)</h1>
        <p>
            Smart India Hackathon is the <b>largest hackathon</b> in the world,
            organized by the <i>Ministry of Education</i>, Government of India.
            It is a <u>10-day national-level open innovation event</u> that aims
            to encourage <mark>innovative problem-solving</mark> among students.
        </p>

        <hr>

        <h2>Key Highlights</h2>
        <p>
            The hackathon runs for <b>10 days</b> and attracts
            <i>thousands of teams</i> from across the country. Participants
            work in teams of up to <u>6 members</u> along with a
            <mark>mentor</mark> to develop working prototypes.
        </p>

        <hr>

        <!-- ===== LOCAL STORAGE SECTION ===== -->
        <div class="storage-section">
            <h2>🔒 Local Storage (Persistent)</h2>
            <p>Data saved here persists even after closing the browser.</p>

            <label for="localName">Enter Name: </label>
            <input type="text" id="localName" placeholder="Your Name">
            <button class="btn" onclick="saveLocal()">Save to LocalStorage</button>
            <button class="btn" onclick="readLocal()">Read from LocalStorage</button>
            <button class="btn btn-delete" onclick="clearLocal()">Clear LocalStorage</button>
            <p class="result" id="localResult"></p>

            <hr>

            <h3>Visit Counter (LocalStorage)</h3>
            <p class="result" id="visitCount"></p>
        </div>

        <hr>

        <!-- ===== SESSION STORAGE SECTION ===== -->
        <div class="storage-section">
            <h2>📂 Session Storage (Per Tab)</h2>
            <p>Data saved here is cleared when the tab is closed.</p>

            <label for="sessionMsg">Enter Message: </label>
            <input type="text" id="sessionMsg" placeholder="Your Message">
            <button class="btn" onclick="saveSession()">Save to SessionStorage</button>
            <button class="btn" onclick="readSession()">Read from SessionStorage</button>
            <button class="btn btn-delete" onclick="clearSession()">Clear SessionStorage</button>
            <p class="result" id="sessionResult"></p>
        </div>

        <hr>

